## StormATC local state — never commit these.
## API keys are stored via the OS secret store, not in files, but be defensive.
secrets.json
secrets.dat
secrets.dat.tmp
usersettings.json
usersettings.json.tmp
appsettings.Local.json
appsettings.*.local.json
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem
*.pfx
*.p12
*.snk
**/recordings/
*.wav

## Local MSFS SDK assemblies. See docs/simconnect-setup.md — the managed SimConnect
## assembly is redistributed by Microsoft under its own licence and is NOT vendored here.
lib/msfs/
**/Microsoft.FlightSimulator.SimConnect.dll
**/SimConnect.dll

