*.zip
*.sha256

## SIA charts: the AIP France VAC charts are kept as published and shipped (see "Cartes VAC/LISEZ-MOI.txt").
## Anything else dropped in that folder (copies, notes, a pilot's own charts) stays local.
Cartes VAC/*
